293 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (1. Quality: We strive to provide the best service to anyone who asks for counseling, and are working to ensure the highest quality of accreditation for Thai counselors. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
294 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (2. Ethical Standards: We are committed to upholding the highest ethical standards through honesty, accountability, transparency, confidentiality, and fairness in our accreditation processes.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
295 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (3. Support & Empowerment: We believe in empowering counselors by providing them with the necessary tools, resources, and support to reach their full potential and to receive equal opportunities. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
296 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (4. Collaboration: ACT aims to build a culture of collaboration and partnership for the development of the counseling field in Thailand, working closely with local as well as international counselors, associations, educational institutions, and more. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
297 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (5. Diversity and Inclusion: At ACT we embrace diversity and promote inclusivity. We do not tolerate any form of discrimination and we expect counselors accredited with us to uphold the same values. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
298 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
