322 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Members of ACT can apply for accreditation by submitting all the required documents by November 15th of each year, which will be reviewed by independent, qualified supervisors before being approved by the ACT board. Application forms will be provided in both Thai and English; the applicant may submit their documents in either of these languages. Once the documents have been approved, applicants will be invited for a personal interview to demonstrate their understanding of the field in a real-time setting. Results will be communicated individually, followed by a public announcement or graduation ceremony the following year. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
