/T (Research presentations: ACT recommends alternating case studies with research presentations, with each counselor in the group presenting at least one research topic per year related to their Continuing Professional Development learnings, a specific counseling methodology, developments in the mental health field, a relevant news items, or other related topics in order to enhance the knowledge of their peers.)
/E (Research presentations: ACT recommends alternating case studies with research presentations, with each counselor in the group presenting at least one research topic per year related to their Continuing Professional Development learnings, a specific counseling methodology, developments in the mental health field, a relevant news items, or other related topics in order to enhance the knowledge of their peers.)
