/E (Example - Discussed couples case that I found very challenging. The clients are an interracial couple with a young child. They have been having a lot of arguments lately. Supervisor advice - further explore the cause of their arguments, is there a recurring theme? Find the root of the issue. How is this affecting their child? Suggested doing separate sessions with each of them later on, supervisor agreed as this will give them space to voice thoughts and emotions that they may not be ready to express to each other yet.  )
